#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:64 74ca4bc5f39249c0a6aa927e94dd26ea
msgid ""
"April 5, 2013: Copter 2.9.1b released. Adds some performance enhancing "
"parameter changes and a few small bug fixes. Details \\ `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/apm-copter-2-9-1-b-has-been-"
"released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2013年4月5日：ArduCopter 2.9.1b正式发布。添加了一些性能增强参数更改和若干小问题修复。详情请见\\ `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/apm-copter-2-9-1-b-has-been-"
"released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:68 be1b599a90c344f7b32a5e93ce0fa5d6
msgid ""
"Jan 17, 2013: Copter 2.9/2.9.1 released. Major performance improvements and "
"some bug fixes. Details \\ `here "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-9-released>`__."
msgstr ""
"2013年1月17日：ArduCopter 2.9/2.9.1正式发布。重大性能提升和若干问题修复。详情请见\\ `此处 "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-9-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:72 be9344e89c2640f889feca127dab7e1c
msgid ""
"Oct 19, 2012: Copter 2.8/2.81 released. Bug fixes and performance "
"improvements. `Details here "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-8-released?xg_sourceactivity>`__."
msgstr ""
"2012年10月19日：ArduCopter 2.8/2.81正式发布。问题修复和性能提升。`详情请见此处 "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-8-released?xg_sourceactivity>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:75 12f7f2baa15542e187e38743bb79ab0b
msgid ""
"Sept 1, 2012: Copter 2.7.2 and 2.7.3 released. Bug fixes and performance "
"improvements. `Details here. "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-7-2-released>`__"
msgstr ""
"2012年9月1日：ArduCopter 2.7.2和2.7.3正式发布。问题修复和性能提升。`详情请见此处。 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-7-2-released>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:78 aa6360f2556641bcb309e702b9a203ca
msgid ""
"Aug 1, 2012: Copter 2.7.1 released. Minor maintenance release with a few bug"
" fixes. Also includes preliminary support for the Digital Motion Processor "
"(DMP) in the MPU-6000 sensor. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-7-1-released>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"2012年8月1日：ArduCopter "
"2.7.1正式发布。含少量问题修复的小型维护版本，另包含对MPU-6000传感器中数字运动处理器（DMP）的初步支持。详情请见 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-7-1-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:84 8c35fb3b2d3f4aa29a4c2cb10299c03d
msgid ""
"July 24, 2012: Copter 2.7 released. Many performance improvements, including"
" in loiter and waypoints. Adds 3-axis camera stabilization, altitude limits "
"and geofencing. More details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-2-7-released>`__ ; details "
"on geofencing :ref:`here <common-ac2_simple_geofence>`."
msgstr ""
"2012年7月24日：ArduCopter "
"2.7正式发布。多项性能提升，包括Loiter和航点导航。新增三轴摄像头稳定、高度限制和围栏功能。更多详情请见 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-2-7-released>`__；围栏详情请见 "
":ref:`此处 <common-ac2_simple_geofence>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:91 2f798b45e5ce400396ef57c5c23bf87b
msgid ""
"June 14, 2012: Copter 2.6 released. Includes performance enhancements, "
"MAVLink 1.0 support, dataflash erase speedups (including proper MAVLink "
"connectivity during erase, to improve first use experience) and support for "
"new 3DR uBlox GPS. Details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-6-released>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"2012年6月14日：ArduCopter 2.6正式发布。包含性能增强、MAVLink "
"1.0支持、dataflash擦除加速（包括擦除期间正常的MAVLink连接以改善首次使用体验）以及对新款3DR uBlox GPS的支持。详情请见 "
"`此处 <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-6-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:98 f0928d0004d64329b2c4669933b3468f
msgid ""
"May 14, 2012: Copter 2.5.5 released. Fixes a bug that affected some APM 2 "
"boards with a newer version of the MPU-6000 sensor. Fixes bug that required "
"some APM 2 boards to be reset after power-on. Various stability "
"improvements. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/updated-"
"arducopter-and-arduplane-code-apm2-users-please-upgrade>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"2012年5月14日：ArduCopter 2.5.5正式发布。修复了影响某些搭载较新版本MPU-6000传感器的APM 2板的问题，以及某些APM "
"2板上电后需要复位的问题。多项稳定性改进。详情请见 `此处 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/updated-"
"arducopter-and-arduplane-code-apm2-users-please-upgrade>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:105 6686112087f843c485fc5bc1f4fe6c04
msgid ""
"March 24, 2012: Copter 2.5.3 released. Maintenance release with some bug "
"fixes, including changing to a more appropriate throttle setting for most "
"people in Alt Hold and re-enabling the Ch 7 auto-trim. `Details here. "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-5-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A816307>`__"
msgstr ""
"2012年3月24日：ArduCopter "
"2.5.3正式发布。含若干问题修复的维护版本，包括为大多数用户在AltHold中更改更合适的油门设置，以及重新启用通道7自动配平。`详情请见此处。 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-5-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A816307>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:110 d3dc90ab9c9d4cf8b54347d11ec90df9
msgid ""
"March 17, 2012: Copter 2.5 released. First code optimized for the APM 2 "
"board, which will now outperform APM 1. Significant improvements in DCM code"
" for performance and stability. More details in the release post `here "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-5-released>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"2012年3月17日：ArduCopter 2.5正式发布。首个针对APM 2板优化的代码版本，现将优于APM "
"1。DCM代码在性能和稳定性方面有显著改进。更多详情请见发布帖 `此处 "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-5-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:117 4b38269d43514a8a8966f487321e9336
msgid ""
"Feb 19, 2012: Copter 2.4 released. This is mostly bug fixes and performance "
"improvements. Recommended for all users. `More details in the release post "
"here. <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-4-released>`__"
msgstr ""
"2012年2月19日：ArduCopter 2.4正式发布。主要是问题修复和性能提升，推荐所有用户升级。`更多详情请见发布帖此处。 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-4-released>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:120 6f8df87d839d4570940b6c11c9515ea3
msgid ""
"Jan 31, 2012: Copter 2.3 released. This is the feature complete release of "
"2.x, and is recommended for all users. More details in the release post "
"`here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-3-released>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"2012年1月31日：ArduCopter 2.3正式发布。这是2.x系列功能完整的版本，推荐所有用户使用。更多详情请见发布帖 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-3-released>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:125 8ab4de3f2a5f48ecafd73ebca4aa52c6
msgid ""
"Jan 14, 2012: Copter 2.2 released. Mostly performance enhancement, bug fixes"
" and improved APM 2 compatibility. Autoland now much improved. More details "
"`here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-2-beta>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"2012年1月14日：ArduCopter 2.2正式发布。主要是性能增强、问题修复和改进的APM 2兼容性。自动降落功能大幅改善。更多详情请见 `此处"
" <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-2-beta>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:131 dfda650456dc44dfa124a8a684140d9b
msgid ""
"Dec 16, 2011: Copter 2.1 released. This is the first version that supports "
"both the APM 1 and APM 2 boards. If you're building it with Arduino, you'll "
"need the \"relaxpatch\" version of Arduino. To harmonize with APM 2, the "
"hardware CLI switch is no longer used--you now get into the CLI by hitting "
"\"Enter\" three times in a terminal. Other details are in the announcement "
"post `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-56>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"2011年12月16日：ArduCopter 2.1正式发布。这是首个同时支持APM 1和APM "
"2板的版本。如果使用Arduino构建，需要Arduino的\"relaxpatch\"版本。为与APM "
"2保持一致，不再使用硬件CLI开关——现在通过在终端中按三次\"回车\"进入CLI。其他详情请见发布公告帖 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-56>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:139 b75915f50b2c4b79aae51b855f9eeaaf
msgid ""
"Dec 3, 2011: Copter 2.0.55 released. Most stable flying version yet. "
"Includes new stability patch by default and a new DCM gain and clamp value "
"that should reduce drift due to linear acceleration in missions or long "
"flights. Switched rate gain calculation to use raw IMU rather than the DCM's"
" omega. This crisps up the response a lot. 1280 has lost local flash "
"logging, sorry, but it's just not supportable any longer. Some older tests "
"have returned now the program memory is freed. Remember, to use the new "
"logging format on the 2560, you need to erase it at least once to format it."
msgstr ""
"2011年12月3日：ArduCopter "
"2.0.55正式发布。迄今最稳定的飞行版本。默认包含新的稳定补丁，以及新的DCM增益和钳位值，可减少任务或长途飞行中因线性加速度引起的漂移。将角速率增益计算切换为使用原始IMU数据而非DCM的omega，大幅提升了响应的敏锐性。1280板失去了本地闪存日志记录功能（抱歉，不再可维护）。随着程序内存的释放，部分旧测试现已恢复。请记住，要在2560板上使用新的日志格式，需要至少擦除一次以进行格式化。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:149 02e203e0e3184cb3b72a07c29bba88cc
msgid ""
"Nov 30, 2011: Copter 2.0.54 released. Bug fixes, better alt hold, CH7 switch"
" to Simple Mode enabled."
msgstr "2011年11月30日：ArduCopter 2.0.54正式发布。问题修复，改进定高，启用CH7开关切换至Simple模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:152 8bcbd599d28d405088e6ecff0b331ce4
msgid ""
"Nov 19, 2011: Copter 2.0.50 released. Many bug fixes and performance "
"enhancements. Log files will now overwrite from the beginning when the "
"dataflash is full (rather than stopping). Initial compatibility with MAVLink"
" 1.0. A full list of changes is `here "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-50>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"2011年11月19日：ArduCopter "
"2.0.50正式发布。多项问题修复和性能增强。当dataflash已满时，日志文件现将从头开始覆盖（而非停止记录）。初步兼容MAVLink "
"1.0。完整变更列表请见 `此处 "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-50>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:158 5e877372b62b4f269f7e3a70ee68c8a3
msgid ""
"Oct 16, 2011: Copter 2.0.49 released. Tweaked Alt Hold PIDs, Loiter PIDs "
"based on SIM testing and feedback. Increased distance error for loiter for "
"faster return to center. Params for camera roll gain fixed."
msgstr ""
"2011年10月16日：ArduCopter 2.0.49正式发布。根据模拟测试和反馈微调了AltHold PID和Loiter "
"PID。增大了Loiter的距离误差以加快向中心回归的速度。修复了摄像头横滚增益的参数问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:163 9cec401ecf314872bcb79416382cb021
msgid ""
"Oct 14, 2011: Copter 2.0.48 released. The PWM output has been set to 400hz "
"(to counter the low pass filter in most Turnigy PWMs). The DCM's Roll and "
"Pitch gains were lowered to .03 (recommendation of Hein Hollander). MAVLink "
"has gotten a re-work for performance and memory savings."
msgstr ""
"2011年10月14日：ArduCopter 2.0.48正式发布。PWM输出已设为400Hz（以抵消大多数Turnigy "
"PWM中的低通滤波器）。DCM的横滚和俯仰增益降低至.03（Hein Hollander的建议）。MAVLink经过重新优化以提升性能和节省内存。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:169 f382f3c1dc4a469e87d6f3099d7a708b
msgid ""
"Oct 7, 2011: Copter 2.0.47 released. Fixed RTL overshooting bug. Better "
"loiter PIDs"
msgstr "2011年10月7日：ArduCopter 2.0.47正式发布。修复了RTL过冲问题，改进了Loiter PID。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:172 7dd36994812d4490ab1124e45701b42c
msgid ""
"Oct 2, 2011: Copter 2.0.46 released. Rolls up all changes since 2.0.42, "
"including improved sensor filtering, loiter and waypoint navigation. Simple "
"mode has been changed and Guided mode added `(see this post for more "
"information). <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-43>`__"
msgstr ""
"2011年10月2日：ArduCopter "
"2.0.46正式发布。汇总了自2.0.42以来的所有更改，包括改进的传感器滤波、Loiter和航点导航。Simple模式已更改，并添加了Guided模式"
" `（详情请见此帖）。 <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-43>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:178 d20cd6a32e104ab59110390f5de8e8d1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sept 11, 2011: Copter 2.0.42 released. Includes much more efficient DCM "
"processing, now running 25% faster. Should be most stable yet. Also includes"
" improved Circle mode."
msgstr ""
"2011年9月11日：ArduCopter "
"2.0.42正式发布。包含效率更高的DCM处理，速度提升25%，应为迄今最稳定的版本。还包含改进的Circle模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:182 404ab8a362b74f6e91634f079d30b68b
msgid ""
"Sept 7, 2011: Copter 2.0.40 released. Totally new control laws, which are "
"much more effective. Loiter should now stay within a 1m box and RTL is rock "
"solid. New Alt Hold mixes the temperature sensor reading with the barometric"
" pressure sensor readings for drift-free results. New flight modes, "
"including user configurable ones. This is a release candidate for the first "
"non-beta code."
msgstr ""
"2011年9月7日：ArduCopter "
"2.0.40正式发布。全新控制律，效果更佳。Loiter应可保持在1m范围内，RTL稳如磐石。新版AltHold将温度传感器读数与气压计读数混合，实现无漂移结果。新的飞行模式，包括用户可配置的模式。这是首个非测试版代码的候选发布版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:189 2e3c92ead4cf4fc7ab81ec2ab214edb5
msgid ""
"August 23, 2011: Copter 2.0.39b released. Many bug fixes and some "
"experimental new control laws. This release is mostly for beta testing "
"feedback to prepare for 2.0.40, which is a non-beta release candidate."
msgstr ""
"2011年8月23日：ArduCopter "
"2.0.39b正式发布。多项问题修复和一些实验性新控制律。此版本主要用于测试版反馈，为作为非测试版候选版本的2.0.40做准备。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:194 5d4a02342f094d2bbf280c26f868ae85
msgid ""
"July 30, 2011: Copter Beta 2.0.38 released. Lots of changes, big and small. "
"Moved ground start to first arming. Added ground start flag. Moved "
"throttle_integrator to 50hz loop. CAMERA_STABILIZER deprecated - now always "
"on. Renamed current logging bit mask to match APM. Added MA filter to PID - "
"D term. Adjusted PIDs based on continued testing and new PID filter. Added "
"MASK_LOG_SET_DEFAULTS to match APM. Moved some stuff out of ground start "
"into system start where it belonged. Added slower Yaw gains for DCM when the"
" copter is in the air. Changed camera output to be none scaled PWM. Fixed "
"bug where ground_temperature was unfiltered. Shortened Baro startup time. "
"Fixed issue with Nav_WP integrator not being reset. RTL no longer yaws "
"towards home. Circle mode for flying a 10m circle around the point where it "
"was engaged (not tested at all! Consider it experimental)."
msgstr ""
"2011年7月30日：ArduCopter Beta "
"2.0.38正式发布。大量大小变更。将地面启动移至首次解锁时执行。添加了地面启动标志。将油门积分器移至50Hz循环。CAMERA_STABILIZER已弃用，现在始终开启。将当前日志位掩码重命名以匹配APM。为PID添加了MA滤波器——D项。根据持续测试和新PID滤波器调整了PID。添加了MASK_LOG_SET_DEFAULTS以匹配APM。将部分内容从地面启动移至系统启动中。为飞行中的偏航增加了更慢的DCM增益。将摄像头输出更改为未缩放的PWM。修复了地面温度未经滤波的问题。缩短了气压计启动时间。修复了Nav_WP积分器未重置的问题。RTL不再朝向Home偏航。Circle模式可绕激活点飞行10m圆圈（完全未测试！视为实验性功能）。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:209 54f30a04ed924a7586b2fd13e71d0032
msgid ""
"July 17, 2011: Copter Beta 2.0.37 released. Added rate of change limit for "
"noisy Sonars. Code converted to static functions to save memory."
msgstr "2011年7月17日：ArduCopter Beta 2.0.37正式发布。为噪声声呐添加了变化率限制。代码转换为静态函数以节省内存。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:213 0e2c29211c3c45b9ae9c4fec7cfc8a2c
msgid ""
"July 16, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.36 released. Added Yaw control when descending in"
" Alt hold, lowered kP & kD for Alt hold a tad, Adjusted RTL behavior to do "
"speed control up to 4m to home, then go into Loiter. Fixed issue with AUTO "
"not getting proper input."
msgstr ""
"2011年7月16日：AC Beta "
"2.0.36正式发布。在AltHold下降时添加了偏航控制，略微降低了AltHold的kP和kD，调整了RTL行为，在距Home "
"4m内进行速度控制，然后进入Loiter。修复了AUTO无法获得正确输入的问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:218 e4eacd3a6c1f4f398491bbcff70329c4
msgid ""
"July 12, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.35 released. Added camera reversing parameters in"
" AP_Var, Added RTL Throttle Hold set/check, Added dynamic speed control to "
"slow down as you reach waypoints and RTL Home, upped Yaw Dead zone slightly."
" Available as a hex firmware download in the Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"2011年7月12日：AC Beta 2.0.35正式发布。在AP_Var中添加了摄像头反向参数，添加了RTL油门保持设置/检查，添加了接近航点和RTL"
" Home时减速的动态速度控制，略微增大了偏航死区。可作为hex固件在Mission Planner中下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:224 2b6f7f2af1964ecd8b7e7fe177e05600
msgid ""
"July 9, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.34 preview released. Lots of new control laws and "
"needs more testing before we give this wide release. Right now it's download"
" only (get the file from the download section above and compile and load "
"with Arduino). Full description of the changes in this release is `here. "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2034-preview>`__"
msgstr ""
"2011年7月9日：AC Beta "
"2.0.34预览版发布。包含大量新控制律，在广泛发布前需要更多测试。目前仅提供下载（从上方下载区下载文件并用Arduino编译上传）。此版本变更的完整说明请见"
" `此处。 <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2034-preview>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:231 f58d4242b4164bfdab4b4bee560bfce4
msgid ""
"July 2, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.32 released: New Loiter PIDs, tuned down control "
"on standard frame, shunk the mixing range for sonar from 3 meters to 2 "
"meters, added framework for Guided mode - not tested! removed pitch and roll"
" deadzone, decoupled S, MPLE mode from LOITER PIDs Synced MAVLink with APM, "
"Logs report correct WP number now. Disabled Sonar spike filter."
msgstr ""
"2011年7月2日：AC Beta 2.0.32发布：新Loiter "
"PID，降低了标准机架的控制量，将声呐的混合范围从3米缩减至2米，添加了Guided模式框架（未测试！），取消了俯仰和横滚死区，将Simple模式与Loiter"
" PID解耦，与APM同步MAVLink，日志现报告正确的航点编号。禁用了声呐峰值滤波器。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:238 989440e16a4a420e927ddeb10716b044
msgid ""
"June 29, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.30 released. Minor bug fixes. Note that there is "
"a known issue with the magnetometer, due to a change in the sensor used in "
"recent DIY Drones magnetometer boards. The code to autodetect which one you "
"have is still a big wonky and compass readings my be off by a factor of 2. "
"We'll fix that in the next update."
msgstr ""
"2011年6月29日：AC Beta 2.0.30正式发布。小幅问题修复。注意，磁力计存在已知问题，原因是近期DIY "
"Drones磁力计板中使用的传感器发生了变化。自动检测您所使用型号的代码仍有些不稳定，罗盘读数可能偏差2倍。我们将在下一次更新中修复此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:245 68211d94f0604ba6b7efc2ae59320fe5
msgid ""
"June 27, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.28 released. Fixed serious bug (exit from "
"!Alt_Hold left quad with controls reversed) in 2.0.26, and other tweaks. All"
" users should upgrade immediately."
msgstr ""
"2011年6月27日：AC Beta "
"2.0.28正式发布。修复了2.0.26中的严重问题（退出!Alt_Hold会导致四轴控制反转），以及其他调整。所有用户应立即升级。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:249 5144a067550b48059998dd1e0ed2d851
msgid ""
"June 24, 2011: AC2 Beta 2.0.26 released: Minor updates. Arming motors now "
"for only Stabilize, Simple, and Acro Modes. V Octo Support."
msgstr ""
"2011年6月24日：AC2 Beta 2.0.26正式发布：小幅更新。现仅在Stabilize、Simple和Acro模式下解锁电机。支持V型八轴。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:252 541ab6e02d9640b4a7b2fd81a5689051
msgid ""
"June 19, 2011: AC2 Beta 2.0.25 released. This brings Copter (traditional "
"heli) into the AC2 trunk, giving it full MAVLink capability, too. Many other"
" tweaks and performance improvements (details `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2024b>`__ ). Getting close "
"now!"
msgstr ""
"2011年6月19日：AC2 Beta "
"2.0.25正式发布。将ArduCopter（传统直升机）纳入AC2主干，同时赋予其完整的MAVLink功能。多项其他调整和性能提升（详情请见 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2024b>`__）。已越来越接近目标！"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:259 259448cb22f04c4294f1cde8282c49c7
msgid ""
"June 5, 2011: Much improved Mission Planner 1.0 released. Check out the "
"`gorgeous new design! <https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/new-apm-"
"planner-10>`__"
msgstr ""
"2011年6月5日：大幅改进的Mission Planner 1.0发布。快来看看 `全新精美设计！ "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/new-apm-planner-10>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:262 e258a45ebfcc4cc3a5a328fed14cd1e7
msgid ""
"June 3, 2011: `AC2 Beta 2.0.23 released. "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2023>`__ Minor bug fixes and "
"tuning to improve loiter and hex airframe performance. Sonar test added to "
"CLI test suite."
msgstr ""
"2011年6月3日：`AC2 Beta 2.0.23正式发布。 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2023>`__ "
"小幅问题修复和调参，改进Loiter和六轴机架性能。CLI测试套件中添加了声呐测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:266 7704f41932e941dfa7cebd1979c9d0b6
msgid ""
"May 27, 2011: AC2 Beta 2.0.16 `released "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/705844:Topic:393643>`__ . Improvements "
"in yaw control, minor changes in LED function, and other bug fixes. The "
"Mission Planner has also been updated, so check the Update menu item in that"
" to upgrade. Just a few more things left to get beta test feedback on before"
" we'll feel confident in taking AC2 out of beta."
msgstr ""
"2011年5月27日：AC2 Beta 2.0.16 `发布 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/705844:Topic:393643>`__。改进偏航控制，LED功能小幅变化及其他问题修复。Mission"
" Planner也已更新，请检查其中的更新菜单项进行升级。在对AC2进行信心十足的非测试版发布之前，仅剩少数几项测试版反馈事项需要收集。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:274 42ae4845fec243978f9fb05de21e8abb
msgid ""
"May 18, 2011: `AC2 beta 2.0.6 "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ac2-206-beta>`__ released. We're "
"still bug-fixing at a rapid pace, so thanks for your patience. The Mission "
"Planner has been significantly revamped, especially on the firmware upload "
"process, which is now based on visual icons. Frame choices are now made at "
"firmware upload time, but orientation (x vs +) can be made in the CLI. We "
"still recommend that new users stick with the `ArduPirates code "
"<https://code.google.com/archive/p/ardupirates/wikis/Softwares_Building.wiki>`__"
" , but people with well-tested hardware are invited to join the AC2 beta "
"test. Feedback at DIY Drones, please."
msgstr ""
"2011年5月18日：`AC2 beta 2.0.6 "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ac2-206-beta>`__ "
"发布。我们仍在快速修复问题，感谢您的耐心等待。Mission "
"Planner已大幅改版，尤其是固件上传流程，现在基于视觉图标。机架选择现在在固件上传时进行，但方向（x与+）可在CLI中配置。我们仍建议新用户坚持使用"
" `ArduPirates代码 "
"<https://code.google.com/archive/p/ardupirates/wikis/Softwares_Building.wiki>`__，但拥有经过充分测试硬件的用户欢迎参与AC2测试版测试。请在DIY"
" Drones上提交反馈。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:284 8fbe96bed1be4ea59b5bfa3f18ae52b8
msgid ""
"May 14, 2011: AC2 beta is improving quickly, thanks to the huge increase in "
"feedback and testing from the open beta release. The latest tested version "
"can always be downloaded from the Mission Planner. At this point, we feel "
"that it is stable enough for most users with well-tested hardware, although "
"please remember it's still in beta so there may still be some bugs and "
"you're flying at your own risk. Go through the setup process carefully and "
"please read the manual before flying!"
msgstr ""
"2011年5月14日：AC2测试版正在快速改进，得益于公开测试版发布后反馈和测试的大幅增加。最新测试版本始终可从Mission "
"Planner下载。目前，我们认为它对大多数拥有经过充分测试硬件的用户而言已足够稳定，但请记住它仍处于测试阶段，可能仍存在一些问题，飞行风险自负。请仔细完成设置流程，飞行前请阅读手册！"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:293 8452d944bb4c46b2936747658b3bfa75
msgid ""
"May 7, 2011: Copter 2 first beta released. Details `here "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-20-beta-first>`__ . "
"This is an early public beta and may be unstable. Some features and portions"
" of the manual are a work in progress and will be changed over the next few "
"weeks. Most users are advised to continue using `ArduPirates code "
"<https://code.google.com/archive/p/ardupirates/wikis/Softwares_Building.wiki>`__"
" until Copter 2 comes out of beta."
msgstr ""
"2011年5月7日：ArduCopter 2首个测试版发布。详情请见 `此处 "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-20-beta-"
"first>`__。这是早期公开测试版，可能不稳定。部分功能和手册章节仍在完善中，将在未来几周内更改。建议大多数用户继续使用 "
"`ArduPirates代码 "
"<https://code.google.com/archive/p/ardupirates/wikis/Softwares_Building.wiki>`__，直到ArduCopter"
" 2正式发布。"

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:301 215a65846ac74a3a86f8b7fa4df41853
msgid ""
"May 5, 2011: Manual revised for Copter 2. Older Copter 1 manual unavailable "
"(was on old google.code site)."
msgstr ""
"2011年5月5日：手册针对ArduCopter 2进行了修订。旧版ArduCopter 1手册不再提供（原在旧Google Code站点上）。"
